<title>SWITZERLAND: Rieter sees lower 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Rieter sees lower 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textile machinery and auto parts maker Rieter Holding AG said its net profit for 1996 was likely to be slightly lower than in 1995 due to restructuring costs.</p>
</text>
